<title>USA: Korea Electric Power sets $300 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Korea Electric Power sets $300 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Korea Electric Power Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER KOREA ELECTRIC POWER CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 2/01/2027</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD  7.00 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS  SPREAD 45 BP	PUTABLE IN THE 10TH YEAR</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
